flowchart TB
  R[Eligible root masks from selected clusters] --> B{Stop condition?}
  B -->|Empty frontier, safe bound, or budget| O[Return current candidates]
  B -->|Continue| P[Take the best pending node]
  P -->|Leaf| L[Read leaf mask and score its rows]
  P -->|Split| S[Read bitplane and queue both nonempty children]
  L --> B
  S --> B
